## Overview

This project investigated the dynamic analysis of serial-parallel Gough–Stewart manipulators, including hybrid, redundant, and hyper-redundant configurations.

## Contributions

- Developed inverse-dynamics models using virtual-work and Jacobian-based formulations.
- Implemented inverse kinematics and trajectory-tracking simulations.
- Performed actuator-force validation.
- Modeled serial-parallel systems in MATLAB and Simscape.
- Investigated minimal and base inertial parameters.

